* {{IPA|en|/ˈhɛmˌlɒk/}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-hemlock.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{audio|en|En-ca-hemlock.oga|Audio (CAN)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# Any of the [[poisonous]] [[umbellifer]]ous [[plant]]s, of the genera
## ''[[Conium]]'', either ''[[Conium maculatum]]'' or {{taxlink|Conium chaerophylloides|species|noshow=1}}.
## ''[[Cicuta]]'', [[water hemlock]] plant.
# The [[poison]] obtained from these ''Conium'' and ''Cicuta'' plants.
# {{senseid|en|Tsuga}} Any of several [[coniferous]] [[tree]]s, of the genus ''[[Tsuga]]'', that grow in [[North America]]; the [[wood]] of such trees.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|Conium}} {{vern|beaver poison}}, {{vern|devil's porridge}}, [[herb bennet]], {{vern|musquash root}}, [[poison hemlock]], {{vern|poison parsley}}, {{vern|spotted corobane}}, {{vern|spotted hemlock}} ''[[Conium maculatum]]''; {{taxlink|Conium chaerophylloides|species|noshow=1}}; {{taxlink|Conium conium maculatum|subspecies|noshow=1}}

